# HELP go_gc_cycles_total Completed GC cycles.
# HELP go_goroutines Live goroutines.
# HELP go_heap_bytes Bytes in live and unswept heap objects.
# HELP http_request_duration_seconds Plain HTTP request latency histogram.
# HELP http_requests_total Plain HTTP requests by status class (WebSocket upgrades excluded).
# HELP lodestone_build_info Always 1; labels name the build (LODESTONE_VERSION) and Go version.
# HELP process_uptime_seconds Seconds since the service started.
# HELP zone_aoi_entities_avg Average interest set size per client by ring, last second.
# HELP zone_aoi_entities_max Largest interest set of any client, last second.
# HELP zone_bytes_in_total Bytes received from clients (incl. framing), monotonic; rate() / zone_players = per-client uplink.
# HELP zone_bytes_out_total Bytes sent to clients (incl. framing), monotonic; rate() / zone_players = per-client downlink.
# HELP zone_client_down_kbps Per-client downlink over the last 5 s, quantiles across clients (incl. WebSocket framing).
# HELP zone_client_up_kbps Per-client uplink over the last 5 s, quantiles across clients.
# HELP zone_kicks_total Kicks by KickCode.
# HELP zone_players Connected players.
# HELP zone_snapshot_bytes_avg Average encoded snapshot size, last second.
# HELP zone_terrain_chunks Chunks in the terrain cache (LOD 0 heights + records).
# HELP zone_terrain_queries_total Ground queries by path: cache (pure Go from chunk heights) or wasm (direct collision_height on a miss).
# HELP zone_tick_jitter_ms |tick spacing - 33.33 ms| quantiles over the last 60 s.
# HELP zone_tick_jitter_ms_lifetime Tick jitter quantiles since start.
# HELP zone_tick_ms Tick duration quantiles over the last 60 s (ms).
# HELP zone_tick_ms_lifetime Tick duration quantiles since start (ms, 10 us buckets).
# HELP zone_tick_spacing_ms Tick start spacing quantiles over the last 60 s.
# HELP zone_writebehind_depth Write-behind queue depth (ops waiting or running).
